{"resource":{"id":"pe-step-by-step-learning-guide","title":"Prompt Engineering — Step-by-Step Learning Guide","category":"AI & Data","difficulty":"Beginner","readingTime":"21 min","pages":23,"lastUpdated":"June 2026","tags":["Prompt Engineering","Prompts","LLM"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1454165804606-c3d57bc86b40?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"An 8-week Prompt Engineering study plan — daily goals, weekly milestones, exercises, self-assessments and a portfolio project to build real skill on schedule."},"toc":[{"id":"prereq","label":"1. Learning Prerequisites"},{"id":"w1","label":"2. Week 1 — LLM Basics"},{"id":"w2","label":"3. Week 2 — Prompt Fundamentals"},{"id":"w3","label":"4. Week 3 — Prompt Patterns"},{"id":"w4","label":"5. Week 4 — Advanced Prompting"},{"id":"w5","label":"6. Week 5 — Context Engineering"},{"id":"w6","label":"7. Week 6 — RAG & AI Agents"},{"id":"w7","label":"8. Week 7 — Prompt Optimization"},{"id":"w8","label":"9. Week 8 — Portfolio Project"},{"id":"career","label":"10. Career Roadmap"},{"id":"review","label":"Step-by-Step Review"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Prompt Engineering — Beginner Guide","tag":"AI & Data","time":"12 min"},{"title":"Prompt Engineering — Complete Tutorial","tag":"AI & Data","time":"64 min"},{"title":"Prompt Engineering — Learning Roadmap","tag":"AI & Data","time":"8 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Learn Prompt Engineering on a fixed 8-week schedule you can actually finish.</li>\n          <li>Turn theory into daily 30–60 minute practice.</li>\n          <li>Track progress with weekly milestones and readiness checkpoints.</li>\n          <li>End the plan with one polished portfolio project.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure\n          src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1517245386807-bb43f82c33c4?w=1600&q=80\"\n          caption=\"8-week step-by-step plan — daily goals, weekly milestones, one capstone project.\"\n        />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"prereq\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Learning Prerequisites</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Comfortable using a web browser and a text editor.</li>\n          <li>Basic reading of Python or JavaScript (needed from Week 6).</li>\n          <li>Access to at least one frontier model (ChatGPT / Claude / Gemini).</li>\n          <li>~5–7 hours per week, ideally spread as 45 minutes a day.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-amber-500/40 bg-amber-500/10 text-amber-900 dark:text-amber-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"M15 14c.2-1 .7-1.7 1.5-2.5 1-.9 1.5-2.2 1.5-3.5A6 6 0 0 0 6 8c0 1 .2 2.2 1.5 3.5.7.7 1.3 1.5 1.5 2.5\"/><path d=\"M9 18h6\"/><path d=\"M10 22h4\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Study rhythm</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">\n          Six short sessions beat one weekend cram. Daily practice compounds.\n        </div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      {WEEKS.map((w) => (\n        <section id=\"w.id\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">w.title</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n          <p><strong>Outcome:</strong> {w.outcome}</p>\n          <div class=\"mt-3 space-y-2\">\n            {w.days.map((d) => (\n              <div key={d.d} class=\"rounded-md border p-3 text-sm\">\n                <div class=\"font-semibold\">{d.d} — {d.goal}</div>\n                <div class=\"text-muted-foreground\">{d.task}</div>\n              </div>\n            ))}\n          </div>\n          <div class=\"mt-4\">\n            <div class=\"font-semibold\">Milestone</div>\n            <p class=\"text-sm\">{w.milestone}</p>\n            <div class=\"mt-2 font-semibold\">Revision checkpoint</div>\n            <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5 text-sm\">\n              {w.checkpoint.map((c) => <li key={c}>{c}</li>)}\n            </ul>\n          </div>\n        </div></section>\n      ))}\n\n      <section id=\"career\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Career Roadmap</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Entry roles</strong>: AI Engineer, LLM Engineer, Applied AI, ML Engineer.</li>\n          <li><strong>Adjacent roles</strong>: DevRel, AI PM, Solutions Architect, Data Scientist.</li>\n          <li><strong>Certifications</strong>: DeepLearning.AI · Google Cloud GenAI · Microsoft AI-102 · AWS AI Practitioner · NVIDIA NLP.</li>\n          <li><strong>Interview prep</strong>: whiteboard RAG, debug live prompts, design eval pipelines.</li>\n          <li><strong>Portfolio</strong>: 3 projects — one RAG, one agent, one integration — each with README + eval numbers.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <Figure\n          src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1531482615713-2afd69097998?w=1600&q=80\"\n          caption=\"Career progression — build → publish → interview → ship in production.\"\n        />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"review\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Step-by-Step Review</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <h3 class=\"font-semibold\">Weekly progress tracker</h3>\n        <table class=\"w-full border-collapse text-sm\">\n          <thead><tr class=\"border-b\"><th class=\"text-left p-2\">Week</th><th class=\"text-left p-2\">Milestone</th></tr></thead>\n          <tbody>\n            {WEEKS.map((w) => (\n              <tr key={w.id} class=\"border-b\"><td class=\"p-2\">{w.title.split(\" — \")[0]}</td><td class=\"p-2\">{w.milestone}</td></tr>\n            ))}\n          </tbody>\n        </table>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Learning milestones</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Week 2 — you write structured prompts by default.</li>\n          <li>Week 4 — you know when advanced patterns help.</li>\n          <li>Week 6 — you can build a RAG and a small agent.</li>\n          <li>Week 8 — one portfolio project shipped.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Final checklist</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Have a golden set of ≥30 examples.</li>\n          <li>Have a prompt library in git with a README per prompt.</li>\n          <li>Track cost + latency + accuracy for your capstone.</li>\n          <li>Have shipped one project publicly.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <h3 class=\"mt-4 font-semibold\">Next learning path</h3>\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Move on to fine-tuning (LoRA, PEFT, DPO).</li>\n          <li>Learn one observability tool (LangSmith / Langfuse).</li>\n          <li>Contribute to an open-source LLM tool.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>Milestone</strong> — verifiable weekly outcome.</li>\n          <li><strong>Checkpoint</strong> — short revision quiz to gate progress.</li>\n          <li><strong>Golden set</strong> — labelled eval examples.</li>\n          <li><strong>Capstone</strong> — end-of-plan portfolio project.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Can I compress this to 4 weeks?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Yes if full-time. Otherwise the 8-week rhythm sticks better.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Do I need a paid API?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Free tiers cover weeks 1–5. Weeks 6–8 benefit from small paid usage.</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>What if I miss a day?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Move it to Sunday. Don't stack multiple days — attention degrades.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">\n          This resource is intended for educational purposes only. Information is compiled from official documentation, academic publications, research papers, industry standards, and trusted educational resources. Prompt Engineering techniques, AI models, APIs, frameworks, and best practices evolve continuously — consult official documentation for the latest information. All trademarks, product names, logos, and intellectual property belong to their respective owners.\n        </p>\n      </div></section>"}